Want to record your running route? Want to see where your friends and family have passed by? Use this running location software! It keeps a complete record of your location and history of your movements, and can share d location with friends and family to keep you safe.

Subscription:
1、Users can only use unlimited time positioning, view history track, view friends and relatives positioning and other functions after paid subscription;
2、The subscription fee will be deducted from iTunes account when users confirm the purchase, $9.9/month for monthly membership, $12.99/quarter and $19.99/lifetime for quarterly membership, of which monthly and quarterly membership can be renewed automatically;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. Apple IDs that automatically renew their subscriptions will be automatically charged to their iTunes accounts 24 hours before each billing cycle expires and the corresponding expiration date will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

